+## October 29
+
+- Mistral Large 4 (`mistral-large-4`, `mistral-large-4-0`) now supports `reasoning_effort` values `low`, `medium`, and `high`, and no longer accepts `none`. Requests that set `reasoning_effort="none"` return HTTP 400. Mistral Large 4 always reasons: use `low` for the least reasoning. If you omit `reasoning_effort`, the model uses `high`. For details, see Mistral Large 4 reasoning effort. API UPDATED
